    "title": "Walk-On's Sports Bistreaux slated to open in late August in New Caney - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emily Lincke ,\n12 hours ago By late August, Walk-On's Sports Bistreaux is expected to open at 22276 Market Place Drive, New Caney. (Courtesy Walk-On's Sports Bistreaux) Work is expected to wrap up soon on the new location of Walk-On's Sports Bistreaux in Valley Ranch Town Center, a spokesperson with Valley Ranch developer The Signorelli Co. confirmed via email April 14. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
